1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:08,970
While you're on the phone,we haven't managed to find a few things we need, like extra pillows for the beds and some washing powder.
既然正在跟你通话，我们找不到一些需要的东西，例如床上富余的枕头和洗衣粉。

2
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:11,110
Is there any here?
这里有吗？

3
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:19,260
Pillows... yes.If you look in the cupboard, the large white one upstairs to the left of the bathroom door
枕头，是的。如果你去看看楼上浴室门左边的白色大橱柜，

4
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:22,950
there should be four or five on the top shelf.
在最上层的架子上应该有四、五个。

5
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:31,120
And if you want to do some washing, there's some powder for that... probably by the back door. 
如果你想要洗衣服，洗衣粉可能在后门。

6
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:34,170
There's a kind of shelf there above the sink.
水槽上面有一个架子。

7
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:38,100
In fact,I'm sure there's some there,in a large blue box.
事实上，我肯定那里会有，在一个大的蓝盒子里。

8
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:42,490
You need about half a cup full for each wash.
洗一次你需要大约半勺。

9
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:50,010
And that reminds me,the spare key to the back door is hanging on a hook on the wall by the sitting room window.
这个提醒我了，后门的备用钥匙挂在客厅窗户旁边的墙上的挂钩上。

10
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:53,000
Please make sure to put it back when you've used it.
当你使完后请确保将它放回原处。

11
00:00:53,010 --> 00:00:56,800
The previous guests lost it in the garden and I had to get another one made.
之前的客人在花园里把它丢了，我不得不再做一把！

12
00:00:56,810 --> 00:01:03,150
And if you have any trouble with the lamps, you'll find some spare bulbs in a large cardboard box.
如果灯有问题，在大纸盒里有备用灯泡。

13
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:07,990
It's on top of the washing machine with all kinds of useful things in it.
在洗衣机的上面有各种有用的东西。

14
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,240
Oh,and another thing I forgot to mention when we last spoke... Yes?
我们上次谈话的时候，我还有一件事忘了说了... 什么事？

15
00:01:12,250 --> 00:01:16,680
I've left you a local map,so you'll be able to find your way around easily.
我给你留了一张本地地图，这样你在周边就不会迷路了。

16
00:01:16,690 --> 00:01:18,770
It shows the whole area.
它涵盖了整个地区，

17
00:01:18,780 --> 00:01:23,530
I put it in the top drawer of the chest under the TV in your bedroom.
我把它放在卧室电视机下面，箱子的第一个抽屉里了。

18
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:26,500
There's a whole file of local information in there too.
里面还有一个当地信息的文件。

19
00:01:26,510 --> 00:01:29,900
Thanks. What about visiting the town?
谢谢。参观城镇怎么样？

20
00:01:29,910 --> 00:01:31,440
Can you give us any advice?
你能给我一些建议吗

21
00:01:31,450 --> 00:01:34,630
Yes.You'll need to take the car.
是的，你需要开车。

22
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:37,420
It's too far to walk from the flat really.
它离公寓真的很远，没法步行。

23
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:41,420
You have to pay to leave your car in all the car parks now I'm afraid.
恐怕你把车放在停车场还得交停车费。

24
00:01:41,430 --> 00:01:47,560
I like the one that's by the station best and you can walk to the town centre from there in five minutes.
我最喜欢车站旁边的那个，从那里走到城镇中心要花5分钟。

25
00:01:47,570 --> 00:01:49,830
That's where all the best restaurants are.
那里有所有最好的餐馆，

26
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:55,300
But if you want a takeaway,the Italian one does really good pasta and pizzas.
但是如果你想打包带走，有一家意大利餐厅做的意大利面和披萨很好吃。

27
00:01:55,310 --> 00:02:04,370
Call 7-3 double 2.8-1 for that one,or 7 double 6,double 1,9for the Chinese.
那家的电话是732281，或者打给中国餐馆766119。

28
00:02:04,380 --> 00:02:08,340
They's both good and they'll both deliver to the flat.
它们都很不错，而且都送外卖到公寓。

29
00:02:08,350 --> 00:02:14,200
As for places to visit, yes, do go and see the railway museum.
至于参观的地方，是的，去看看铁路博物馆吧。

30
00:02:14,210 --> 00:02:17,130
The exhibition is small but really good.
展览很小但是很棒。

31
00:02:17,140 --> 00:02:26,990
It gets very crowded on Sundays, so I suggest you visit it on a quieter day, later in the week, but not on Thursdays which is market day.
周末人很多，所以我建议你在安静的日子里去，每周靠后的几天，但是不要在赶集日，周四去。

32
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:32,720
you won't find anywhere to park and it's also the only day of the week when they're not open!
你将找不到停车位，而且这是他们一周唯一关门的一天！

33
00:02:32,730 --> 00:02:37,920
Anything else? Not for the moment.Thanks!
还有什么要了解的吗？-暂时没有了，谢谢！
